    "    \"    Infer spatial patch grid dimensions from encoder output.\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    Assumes N = T × H_patch × W_patch with square spatial grid.\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    \\\"\\\"\\\"\\n\",\n",
